{"games":[{"id":91815352850707,"name":"+1 Speed Freddy Escape","desc":"📚 Welcome To +1 speed Freddy Escape🐻\n\n❓ HOW TO PLAY: ❓\n📌 You’re trapped in a haunted pizzeria packed with killer animatronics… can you escape?\n🏃‍♂️ Run through dark halls, squeeze past broken doors, and dodge roaming animatronics!\n🧠 Listen for footsteps, watch the cameras, and time your moves to survive!\n💰 Earn cash by reaching checkpoints, finding key items, and escaping each stage!\n📈 Upgrade your speed, stamina, flashlight power, and stealth to outsmart the night shift traps!\n\n⚡ Get faster and smarter every run and master the art of surviving the pizzeria!\n🏆 Climb the leaderboards and prove you’re the #1 escape artist!\n🎮 Can you ESCAPE every level of animatronic madness?\n\n👍 Like & Favorite the game to support more scary escapes!\n🔔 Join our group for exclusive rewards and game news!","path":"/game/91815352850707-1-speed-freddy-escape","slug":"91815352850707-1-speed-freddy-escape","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/79f213a74589c4c680b8e5f980bf79c63f7ab4dc2633dc8dca5fd44406c6869a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-732f5e5174ea54a0a634d0ef6b3b989d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":32,"visitor":8229735,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-07T05:31:32.913Z","creator":{"name":"Fun Forge Interactive","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":123901549209405,"name":"[CARRY] Rasa Ini Tower Akukuat","desc":"English:\nEasy Red Laser Tower With Buff !\n\nBahasa:\nYTTA, ini tower laser gampang\n\nTagalog:\nang madaling pulang laser tower sa kalawakan\n\ntags: laser,tower,obby,doncelg","path":"/game/123901549209405-rasa-ini-tower-akukuat","slug":"123901549209405-rasa-ini-tower-akukuat","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4acb42e99279049b60023b883433e3495ef895bc7f0219a88a943f22f0f2abdd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3a56c49e9b8b16fe9bba834076023887/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":32,"visitor":